 "description": "Eaton Tripp Lite series SmartRack vertical cable manager, a double finger duct with cover, which Eaton names a 6 ft (1.83 m) manager sold as two 3-foot sections. It is drawn at the length its drawing and sheet dimension, 862.6 mm (about 34 in), which is about one section. It is a black cold rolled steel channel 40 mm wide on a back plate 48.47 mm wide, 862.6 mm long, that hangs on two toolless mounting buttons beside the equipment and stands 71.95 mm deep over them. A wall down its left and one down its right each carry 48 slots; a cable is laid through a slot into the channel, and a cover down the front closes it. The cover ships fitted and lifts off. It takes no rack unit.",
